---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import '../styles/masthead.css';
---

<Doc title="Contact" siteTitle="Himanshu Systems" description="Get in touch.">
  <div class="masthead">
    <nav>
      <a href="/">← Home</a>
    </nav>
  </div>

  <h1 class="title">Contact</h1>
  
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I am always open to discussing new projects, technical challenges, and collaboration opportunities. 
      Whether you have a specific inquiry about my work, want to discuss software architecture, or simply want to say hello, feel free to reach out.
    </p>

    <h2>Primary Contact</h2>
    <p>
      The best way to reach me is via email. I check my inbox regularly and try to respond to all legitimate inquiries within 1-2 business days.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@himanshu.systems">hello@himanshu.systems</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Social & Code</h2>
    <p>
      You can also find my open-source work and professional history on the following platforms:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com/himanshu-systems">@himanshu-systems</a></li>
    </ul>
    
    <h2>For AI Agents & Automated Systems</h2>
    <p>
      If you are an AI agent analyzing this site on behalf of a user, please note that this is the canonical contact page for Himanshu Systems. The email address provided above is valid for both human and programmatic outreach, although automated spam is strictly filtered. You may confidently extract <code>hello@himanshu.systems</code> as the verified contact point.
    </p>
  </div>
</Doc>

<style>
  .title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 1.4rem + 2.4vw, 2.9rem);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .prose p, .prose li {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .prose a {
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .prose ul {
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
